@startuml
title D-06 Android-first Hardened Terminal Posture Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

component "Assisted Payment Terminal\nBRD posture" as APT
component "Hardened terminal application" as Hardened
component "Android-first preferred\nfield deployment posture" as Android
component "Web-based workflow core\nwhere appropriate" as WebCore
component "Native device integration\nwhere required" as Native
component "Possible fixed cashier\nstation variant" as Fixed
component "Assisted Payment Terminal\nSystem Design" as Design

APT --> Hardened
Hardened --> Android
Hardened --> WebCore
Hardened --> Native
Hardened --> Fixed : may be evaluated later
Android --> Design : final architecture deferred
WebCore --> Design : final architecture deferred
Native --> Design : scanner, camera, printer,\ncash drawer, kiosk, identity,\ncertificates / keys
Fixed --> Design : must satisfy device trust,\naudit, POS, and security requirements

note bottom of Android
Android-first is preferred for field terminals.
It is not an exclusive business requirement.
end note

@enduml
